Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: compound_signature (ADR 0007 probe)
Purpose:
    Probe whether EdgeFingerprint = (RSignature, LocalityProfile) on a
    single mixed graph already produces natural pattern-repetition
    candidates, informing β's question (ii): "what counts as a
    nameable pattern?"

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0007 (edge_fingerprint = compound of ADR 0005 + ADR 0006).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0007.
    Runner: v2/examples/compound_signature.rs.

Input graph:
    Disjoint union of five canonical structures:
    - 5-chain     c1 -> c2 -> c3 -> c4 -> c5         (4 edges)
    - 3-cycle     k1 -> k2 -> k3 -> k1               (3 edges)
    - out-star    s -> {sa, sb, sc}                  (3 edges)
    - tree        t1 -> t2, t1 -> t3, t2 -> t4       (3 edges)
    - isolated    ie1 -> ie2                         (1 edge)
    Total: 14 edges.

Command:
    cargo run --example compound_signature

